         Executive Director of the IAB
         Intel, JF2-64
         2111 NE 25th Avenue
         Hillsboro, OR 97124

         1-503-696-8972

         AWeinrib@ibeam.jf.intel.com


         Brian E. Carpenter
         Chair of the IAB
         IBM United Kingdon Laboratories
         Hursley Park
         Winchester
         Hampshire SO21 2JN

         +44 1962 816833

         brian@hursley.ibm.com












