          "children": [
            {
              "textContent": "RFC-1123",
              "type": "Text",
            },
          ],
          "nodeName": "a",
          "type": "Element",
        },
        {
          "textContent": ")
   and "Requirements for IP Version 4 Routers" (",
          "type": "Text",
        },
        {
          "attributes": {
            "href": "/info/rfc1812/",
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "textContent": "RFC-1812",
              "type": "Text",
            },
          ],
          "nodeName": "a",
          "type": "Element",
        },
        {
          "textContent": ").

      How to obtain the most recent edition of this "Internet Official
      Protocol Standards" memo:

         The file "in-notes/std/std1.txt" may be copied via FTP from the
         FTP.ISI.EDU computer using the FTP username "anonymous" and FTP
         password "guest".







