                              "textContent": "
            ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {
                                "id": "section-1.2-3.4.1",
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "textContent": "An entity that can participate in a QUIC connection by generating, receiving,
and processing QUIC packets. There are only two types of endpoints in QUIC:
client and server.",
