",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {
                                "id": "section-19.3.2-1",
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "textContent": "The ACK frame uses the least significant bit of the type value (that is, type
0x03) to indicate ECN feedback and report receipt of QUIC packets with
associated ECN codepoints of ECT(0), ECT(1), or ECN-CE in the packet's IP
header.  ECN counts are only present when the ACK frame type is 0x03.",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "class": "pilcrow",
                                    "href": "#section-19.3.2-1",
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "textContent": "¶",
                                      "type": "Text",
                                    },
                                  ],
                                  "nodeName": "a",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                              ],
                              "nodeName": "p",
                              "type": "Element",
                            },
                            {
                              "textContent": "
",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {
                                "id": "section-19.3.2-2",
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "textContent": "When present, there are three ECN counts, as shown in ",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
