",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.4-2",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "After sending a RESET_STREAM, an endpoint ceases transmission and retransmission
of STREAM frames on the identified stream.  A receiver of RESET_STREAM can
discard any data that it already received on that stream.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.4-2",
                          },
                          "children": [
