",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.7-1",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "A server sends a NEW_TOKEN frame (type=0x07) to provide the client with a token
to send in the header of an Initial packet for a future connection.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.7-1",
                          },
                          "children": [
