                  "type": "Text",
                },
                {
                  "attributes": {
                    "id": "section-19.8",
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "textContent": "
        ",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "name-stream-frames",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "
",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "section-number selfRef",
                            "href": "#section-19.8",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "19.8. ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "section-name selfRef",
                            "href": "#name-stream-frames",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "STREAM Frames",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "
        ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "h3",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.8-1",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "STREAM frames implicitly create a stream and carry stream data.  The Type field
in the STREAM frame takes the form 0b00001XXX (or the set of values from 0x08 to
0x0f).  The three low-order bits of the frame type determine the fields that are
present in the frame:",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.8-1",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "data-component": "HorizontalScrollable",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "normal",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "
",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {
                                "class": "normal",
                                "id": "section-19.8-2.1",
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "textContent": "The OFF bit (0x04) in the frame type is set to indicate that there is an
Offset field present.  When set to 1, the Offset field is present.  When set
to 0, the Offset field is absent and the Stream Data starts at an offset of 0
(that is, the frame contains the first bytes of the stream, or the end of a
stream that includes no data).",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "class": "pilcrow",
                                    "href": "#section-19.8-2.1",
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "textContent": "¶",
                                      "type": "Text",
                                    },
                                  ],
                                  "nodeName": "a",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                                {
                                  "textContent": "
",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                              ],
                              "nodeName": "li",
                              "type": "Element",
                            },
                            {
                              "textContent": "
          ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {
                                "class": "normal",
                                "id": "section-19.8-2.2",
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "textContent": "The LEN bit (0x02) in the frame type is set to indicate that there is a Length
field present.  If this bit is set to 0, the Length field is absent and the
Stream Data field extends to the end of the packet.  If this bit is set to 1,
the Length field is present.",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "class": "pilcrow",
                                    "href": "#section-19.8-2.2",
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "textContent": "¶",
                                      "type": "Text",
                                    },
                                  ],
                                  "nodeName": "a",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                                {
                                  "textContent": "
",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                              ],
                              "nodeName": "li",
                              "type": "Element",
                            },
                            {
                              "textContent": "
          ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {
                                "class": "normal",
                                "id": "section-19.8-2.3",
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "textContent": "The FIN bit (0x01) indicates that the frame marks the end of the stream. The
final size of the stream is the sum of the offset and the length of this
frame.",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "class": "pilcrow",
                                    "href": "#section-19.8-2.3",
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "textContent": "¶",
                                      "type": "Text",
                                    },
                                  ],
                                  "nodeName": "a",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                                {
                                  "textContent": "
",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                              ],
                              "nodeName": "li",
                              "type": "Element",
                            },
                            {
                              "textContent": "
        ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "ul",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "div",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.8-3",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "An endpoint ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "bcp14",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "MUST",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "span",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " terminate the connection with error STREAM",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "_STATE",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "_ERROR",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " if it
receives a STREAM frame for a locally initiated stream that has not yet been
created, or for a send-only stream.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.8-3",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.8-4",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "STREAM frames are formatted as shown in ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "xref",
                            "href": "#fig-stream",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "Figure 32",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": ".",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.8-4",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "name-stream-frame-format",
                      },
                      "children": [],
                      "nodeName": "span",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "fig-stream",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "
",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "id": "figure-32",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "
          ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {
                                "class": "artwork art-text alignLeft",
                                "id": "section-19.8-5.1",
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "textContent": "
",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "data-component": "HorizontalScrollable",
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "attributes": {},
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "textContent": "STREAM Frame {
  Type (i) = 0x08..0x0f,
  Stream ID (i),
  [Offset (i)],
  [Length (i)],
  Stream Data (..),
}
",
                                          "type": "Text",
                                        },
                                      ],
                                      "nodeName": "pre",
                                      "type": "Element",
                                    },
                                  ],
                                  "nodeName": "div",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                                {
                                  "textContent": "
",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                              ],
                              "nodeName": "div",
                              "type": "Element",
                            },
                            {
                              "textContent": "
",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {},
