                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.10-1",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "A MAX_STREAM_DATA frame (type=0x11) is used in flow control to inform a peer
of the maximum amount of data that can be sent on a stream.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.10-1",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.10-2",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "A MAX_STREAM_DATA frame can be sent for streams in the "Recv" state; see
",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "xref",
                            "href": "#stream-recv-states",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "Section 3.2",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": ". Receiving a MAX_STREAM_DATA frame for a
locally initiated stream that has not yet been created ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "bcp14",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "MUST",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "span",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " be treated as a
connection error of type STREAM",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "_STATE",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "_ERROR",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": ".",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "  An endpoint that receives a
MAX_STREAM_DATA frame for a receive-only stream ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "bcp14",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "MUST",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "span",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " terminate the connection
with error STREAM",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "_STATE",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
