                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "
        ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "h3",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.14-1",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "A sender ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "bcp14",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "SHOULD",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "span",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " send a STREAMS_BLOCKED frame (type=0x16 or 0x17) when it wishes
to open a stream but is unable to do so due to the maximum stream limit set by
its peer; see ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "xref",
                            "href": "#frame-max-streams",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "Section 19.11",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": ".  A STREAMS_BLOCKED frame of type 0x16 is
used to indicate reaching the bidirectional stream limit, and a STREAMS_BLOCKED
frame of type 0x17 is used to indicate reaching the unidirectional stream limit.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.14-1",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.14-2",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "A STREAMS_BLOCKED frame does not open the stream, but informs the peer that a
new stream was needed and the stream limit prevented the creation of the stream.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.14-2",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.14-3",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "STREAMS_BLOCKED frames are formatted as shown in ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
