                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " frame that repeats a previously
issued connection ID with a different Stateless Reset Token field value or a
different Sequence Number field value, or if a sequence number is used for
