                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " frame (type=0x19) to indicate that it
will no longer use a connection ID that was issued by its peer. This includes
the connection ID provided during the handshake.  Sending a RETIRE",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
