            ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {
                                "id": "section-19.19-6.6.1",
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "textContent": "A variable-length integer specifying the length of the reason phrase in bytes.
Because a CONNECTION",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {},
                                  "children": [],
                                  "nodeName": "wbr",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                                {
                                  "textContent": "_CLOSE",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {},
                                  "children": [],
                                  "nodeName": "wbr",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                                {
                                  "textContent": " frame cannot be split between packets, any limits
on packet size will also limit the space available for a reason phrase.",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "class": "pilcrow",
                                    "href": "#section-19.19-6.6.1",
