          ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "id": "section-19.19-6.8",
                            "style": "margin-left:1.5em",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "
            ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {
                                "id": "section-19.19-6.8.1",
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "textContent": "Additional diagnostic information for the closure.  This can be zero length if
the sender chooses not to give details beyond the Error Code value.  This
",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "class": "bcp14",
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "textContent": "SHOULD",
                                      "type": "Text",
                                    },
                                  ],
                                  "nodeName": "span",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                                {
                                  "textContent": " be a UTF-8 encoded string ",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {},
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "textContent": "[",
                                      "type": "Text",
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "attributes": {
                                        "class": "xref",
                                        "href": "#RFC3629",
                                      },
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "textContent": "RFC3629",
                                          "type": "Text",
                                        },
                                      ],
                                      "nodeName": "a",
                                      "type": "Element",
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "textContent": "]",
                                      "type": "Text",
                                    },
                                  ],
                                  "nodeName": "span",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                                {
                                  "textContent": ", though the frame does not carry
information, such as language tags, that would aid comprehension by any entity
other than the one that created the text.",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "class": "pilcrow",
                                    "href": "#section-19.19-6.8.1",
                                  },
