                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "name-extension-frames",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "
",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "section-number selfRef",
                            "href": "#section-19.21",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "19.21. ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "section-name selfRef",
                            "href": "#name-extension-frames",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "Extension Frames",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "
        ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "h3",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.21-1",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "QUIC frames do not use a self-describing encoding.  An endpoint therefore needs
to understand the syntax of all frames before it can successfully process a
packet.  This allows for efficient encoding of frames, but it means that an
endpoint cannot send a frame of a type that is unknown to its peer.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.21-1",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.21-2",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "An extension to QUIC that wishes to use a new type of frame ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "bcp14",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "MUST",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "span",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " first ensure
that a peer is able to understand the frame.  An endpoint can use a transport
parameter to signal its willingness to receive extension frame types. One
transport parameter can indicate support for one or more extension frame types.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.21-2",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.21-3",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "Extensions that modify or replace core protocol functionality (including frame
types) will be difficult to combine with other extensions that modify or
replace the same functionality unless the behavior of the combination is
explicitly defined.  Such extensions ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "bcp14",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "SHOULD",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "span",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " define their interaction with
previously defined extensions modifying the same protocol components.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.21-3",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.21-4",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "Extension frames ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "bcp14",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "MUST",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "span",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " be congestion controlled and ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "bcp14",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "MUST",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "span",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " cause an ACK frame to
be sent.  The exception is extension frames that replace or supplement the ACK
frame.  Extension frames are not included in flow control unless specified
in the extension.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.21-4",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-19.21-5",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "An IANA registry is used to manage the assignment of frame types; see
",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "xref",
                            "href": "#iana-frames",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "Section 22.4",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": ".",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-19.21-5",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                  ],
                  "nodeName": "section",
                  "type": "Element",
                },
                {
                  "textContent": "
",
                  "type": "Text",
                },
              ],
              "nodeName": "div",
              "type": "Element",
            },
            {
              "textContent": "
",
              "type": "Text",
            },
          ],
          "nodeName": "section",
          "type": "Element",
        },
        {
          "textContent": "
",
          "type": "Text",
        },
      ],
      "nodeName": "div",
      "type": "Element",
    },
    {
      "textContent": "
",
      "type": "Text",
    },
    {
      "attributes": {
        "id": "error-codes",
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "textContent": "
",
          "type": "Text",
        },
        {
          "attributes": {
            "id": "section-20",
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "textContent": "
      ",
              "type": "Text",
            },
            {
              "attributes": {
                "id": "name-error-codes",
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "textContent": "
",
                  "type": "Text",
                },
                {
                  "attributes": {
                    "class": "section-number selfRef",
                    "href": "#section-20",
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "textContent": "20. ",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                  ],
                  "nodeName": "a",
                  "type": "Element",
                },
                {
                  "attributes": {
                    "class": "section-name selfRef",
                    "href": "#name-error-codes",
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "textContent": "Error Codes",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                  ],
                  "nodeName": "a",
                  "type": "Element",
                },
                {
                  "textContent": "
      ",
                  "type": "Text",
                },
              ],
              "nodeName": "h2",
              "type": "Element",
            },
            {
              "textContent": "
",
              "type": "Text",
            },
            {
              "attributes": {
                "id": "section-20-1",
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "textContent": "QUIC transport error codes and application error codes are 62-bit unsigned
integers.",
                  "type": "Text",
                },
                {
                  "attributes": {
                    "class": "pilcrow",
                    "href": "#section-20-1",
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "textContent": "¶",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                  ],
                  "nodeName": "a",
                  "type": "Element",
                },
              ],
              "nodeName": "p",
              "type": "Element",
            },
            {
              "textContent": "
",
              "type": "Text",
            },
            {
              "attributes": {
                "id": "transport-error-codes",
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "textContent": "
",
                  "type": "Text",
                },
                {
                  "attributes": {
                    "id": "section-20.1",
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "textContent": "
        ",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "name-transport-error-codes",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "
",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "section-number selfRef",
                            "href": "#section-20.1",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "20.1. ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "section-name selfRef",
                            "href": "#name-transport-error-codes",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "Transport Error Codes",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "
        ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "h3",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-20.1-1",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "This section lists the defined QUIC transport error codes that can be used in a
CONNECTION",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "_CLOSE",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "wbr",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " frame with a type of 0x1c.  These errors apply to the entire
connection.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-20.1-1",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "class": "break",
                      },
                      "children": [],
                      "nodeName": "span",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "class": "dlParallel",
                        "id": "section-20.1-2",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "
          ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "id": "section-20.1-2.1",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "NO_ERROR (0x00):",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "dt",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "
          ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "id": "section-20.1-2.2",
                            "style": "margin-left:1.5em",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "
            ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {
                                "id": "section-20.1-2.2.1",
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "textContent": "An endpoint uses this with CONNECTION",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {},
                                  "children": [],
                                  "nodeName": "wbr",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                                {
                                  "textContent": "_CLOSE",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {},
                                  "children": [],
                                  "nodeName": "wbr",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                                {
                                  "textContent": " to signal that the connection is
being closed abruptly in the absence of any error.",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "class": "pilcrow",
                                    "href": "#section-20.1-2.2.1",
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "textContent": "¶",
                                      "type": "Text",
                                    },
                                  ],
                                  "nodeName": "a",
                                  "type": "Element",
                                },
                              ],
                              "nodeName": "p",
                              "type": "Element",
                            },
                            {
                              "textContent": "
",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "dd",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "
          ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "break",
                          },
                          "children": [],
                          "nodeName": "dd",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "
",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "id": "section-20.1-2.3",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "INTERNAL_ERROR (0x01):",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "dt",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": "
          ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "id": "section-20.1-2.4",
                            "style": "margin-left:1.5em",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "
            ",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                            {
                              "attributes": {
                                "id": "section-20.1-2.4.1",
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "textContent": "The endpoint encountered an internal error and cannot continue with the
connection.",
                                  "type": "Text",
                                },
                                {
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "class": "pilcrow",
                                    "href": "#section-20.1-2.4.1",
                                  },
