                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-20.1-3",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "See ",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "xref",
                            "href": "#iana-error-codes",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "Section 22.5",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                        {
                          "textContent": " for details on registering new error codes.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-20.1-3",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-20.1-4",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "In defining these error codes, several principles are applied.  Error conditions
that might require specific action on the part of a recipient are given unique
codes.  Errors that represent common conditions are given specific codes.
Absent either of these conditions, error codes are used to identify a general
function of the stack, like flow control or transport parameter handling.
Finally, generic errors are provided for conditions where implementations are
unable or unwilling to use more specific codes.",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "pilcrow",
                            "href": "#section-20.1-4",
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "textContent": "¶",
                              "type": "Text",
                            },
                          ],
                          "nodeName": "a",
                          "type": "Element",
                        },
                      ],
                      "nodeName": "p",
                      "type": "Element",
                    },
                    {
                      "textContent": "
",
                      "type": "Text",
                    },
                  ],
                  "nodeName": "section",
                  "type": "Element",
                },
                {
                  "textContent": "
",
                  "type": "Text",
                },
              ],
              "nodeName": "div",
              "type": "Element",
            },
            {
              "textContent": "
",
              "type": "Text",
            },
            {
              "attributes": {
                "id": "app-error-codes",
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "textContent": "
",
                  "type": "Text",
                },
                {
