                    },
                    {
                      "attributes": {
                        "id": "section-22.5-2",
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "textContent": "The "QUIC Transport Error Codes" registry governs a 62-bit space.  This space is
split into three ranges that are governed by different policies.  Permanent
registrations in this registry are assigned using the Specification Required
policy (",
                          "type": "Text",
                        },
                        {
                          "attributes": {},
                          "children": [
                            {
